<title>FRANCE: Rouen March 1-5 wheat exports 143,259 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen March 1-5 wheat exports 143,259 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheat exports from the French port of Rouen reached 143,259 tonnes between March 1 and March 5, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Grain exports totalled 345,000 tonnes for the whole of March</p>
<p>1996.</p>
<p>Officials gave the following breakdown by destination (in tonnes).</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>    West Africa		   17,000</p>
<p>    Algeria			 48,059</p>
<p>    Egypt			   31,500</p>
<p>    Britain			  1,500</p>
<p>    Ireland			  1,500</p>
<p>    Mozambique		    24,200</p>
<p>    Poland			  19,500</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
